utiful bride\nwon with spear and nails before his death.\nNext to the other rests that leader\nunder whom the ungrateful, fickle,\nstiff-necked people lived on manna.\nOpposite Peter you see Anna,\nso content gazing at her daughter\nshe doesn't move her eyes while singing Hosanna.\nOpposite the eldest father of our house\nsits Lucy, she who moved your Lady\nwhen you bent your brow to rush downward.\nBut since the moments of your vision fly,\nhere we'll stop, like a good tailor\nwho cuts the coat to fit his cloth.\nWe'll turn our eyes toward the Primal Love,\nso looking on him you may penetrate\nas far as possible into his radiance.\nBut lest perhaps you fall back,\nbeating wings you think move you forward,\ngrace must be obtained through prayer—\ngrace from her who has power to help you.\nFollow me with your love\nso your heart won't turn from my words.\"\nAnd he began this holy prayer:","startTime":239.52,"endTime":341.6,"words":[{"word":"So","start":239.68,"end":239.84},{"word":"I","start":239.84,"end":240.12},{"word":"turned","start":240.12,"end":240.44},{"word":"again","start":240.44,"end":240.72},{"word":"to","start":240.72,"end":240.88},{"word":"the","start":240.88,"end":241},{"word":"teaching","start":241,"end":241.4},{"word":"of","start":241.4,"end":241.52},{"word":"him","start":241.52,"end":241.92},{"word":"who","start":241.92,"end":242.08},{"word":"found","start":242.08,"end":242.44},{"word":"delight","start":242.44,"end":242.88},{"word":"in","start":242.88,"end":243.28},{"word":"Mary","start":243.28,"end":243.68},{"word":"as","start":243.68,"end":243.84},{"word":"the","start":243.84,"end":244},{"word":"morning","start":244,"end":244.52},{"word":"star","start":244.52,"end":244.8},{"word":"delights","start":244.8,"end":245.32},{"word":"in","start":245.32,"end":245.6},{"word":"sun.","start":245.6,"end":246.56},{"word":"He","start":246.56,"end":246.84},{"word":"answered:","start":246.84,"end":247.72},{"word":"\"All","start":247.72,"end":247.92},{"word":"the",